<title>NEW ZEALAND: RTRS-FOREIGNERS HOLD 60.3 PCT OF NZ GOVT SECS.</title>
<headline>RTRS-FOREIGNERS HOLD 60.3 PCT OF NZ GOVT SECS.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proportion of New Zealand government securities held by foreigners rose in July to 60.3 percent from 59.8 percent in June, the Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>			  Jun 1997	   May 1997	  June 1996</p>
<p>Bills &amp; Bonds    Value   Pct(*)   Value   Pct(*)   Value  Pct(*)</p>
<p>T Bills	 3,030.3    42.6   3,050.8   48.4   2,917.4    44.8</p>
<p>Govt Bonds   11,671.3    67.6  11,795.0   63.7  11,734.1    57.4</p>
<p>Total Securities</p>
<p>		 14,701.6    60.3  14,845.8   59.8  14,651.5    54.4</p>
<p>Benchmark Bonds Jul-97	     -	  -	 627.6   40.9     963.9    49.1</p>
<p>Jul-98	  1,458.6    59.6   1,009.5   41.2   1,534.7    62.7</p>
<p>Feb-00	  1,748.0    58.1   2,185.9   72.6   1,747.0    58.0</p>
<p>Feb-01	  1,994.8    75.3   1,609.2   64.4   1,243.4    73.1</p>
<p>Mar-02	  1,890.4    75.3   2,148.6   85.5   1,391.5    55.4</p>
<p>Apr-04	  1,738.5    57.1   1,695.0   55.7   1,802.5    59.2</p>
<p>Nov-06	  2,389.6    86.0   2,185.6   78.7   1,709.7    61.6</p>
<p>Jul-09	     80.0    53.3	  -	-	   -	 -</p>
<p>Feb-16	    371.4    62.7     333.6   56.3	73.1    22.3</p>
<p>(*) Percentages represent non-resident holdings as a percentage of the total securities in the hands of the market, excluding RB/Treasury holdings.</p>
